/F2 20 Tf 54 760 Td (Django Framework and MVT Model Notes) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 732 Td () Tj
/F2 14 Tf 54 717 Td (1. What is Django?) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 695 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 680 Td (Django is a high-level Python web framework used to build secure,) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 665 Td (maintainable, and scalable web applications quickly. It follows the) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 650 Td ("batteries-included" philosophy, meaning it provides many built-in features) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 635 Td (such as URL routing, database integration, authentication, form handling, an) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 620 Td (admin interface, security tools, and template rendering.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 605 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 590 Td (Django is commonly used for content management systems, e-commerce platforms,) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 575 Td (social applications, APIs, dashboards, and data-driven websites.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 560 Td () Tj
/F2 14 Tf 54 545 Td (2. Key Features of Django) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 523 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 508 Td (? **Rapid development:** Django provides ready-made components that reduce) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 493 Td (  repetitive coding.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 478 Td (? **Secure by default:** It helps protect against common web attacks such as) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 463 Td (  cross-site scripting, cross-site request forgery, SQL injection, and) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 448 Td (  clickjacking.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 433 Td (? **Scalable architecture:** Django can support small projects as well as) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 418 Td (  large, high-traffic applications.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 403 Td (? **Object-Relational Mapper \(ORM\):** Developers can interact with databases) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 388 Td (  using Python classes instead of writing raw SQL for most operations.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 373 Td (? **Automatic admin interface:** Django can generate a powerful admin panel) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 358 Td (  from application models.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 343 Td (? **Reusable apps:** A Django project can be divided into multiple apps, and) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 328 Td (  each app can be reused in other projects.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 313 Td (? **Template system:** Django templates help separate presentation logic from) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 298 Td (  business logic.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 283 Td () Tj
/F2 14 Tf 54 268 Td (3. Django Project Structure) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 246 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 231 Td (A typical Django project contains a project package and one or more apps.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 216 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 201 Td (? **Project:** The complete web application and its global configuration.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 186 Td (? **App:** A modular component that handles one specific feature, such as) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 171 Td (  users, blog posts, orders, or payments.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 156 Td (? **settings.py:** Stores configuration such as installed apps, middleware,) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 141 Td (  database settings, static files, and security settings.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 126 Td (? **urls.py:** Maps URL patterns to views.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 111 Td (? **models.py:** Defines database tables using Python classes.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 96 Td (? **views.py:** Contains request-handling logic.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 81 Td (? **templates:** Contains HTML files used to display pages.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 285 30 Td (Page 1) Tj
ET
endstream
