/F1 10.5 Tf 70 760 Td (? Selecting templates for rendering.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 745 Td (? Returning HTTP responses.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 730 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 715 Td (Example concept:) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 700 Td () Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 685 Td (    def student_list\(request\):) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 673 Td (        students = Student.objects.all\(\)) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 661 Td (        return render\(request, "students/list.html", {"students":) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 649 Td (students}\)) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 637 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 622 Td (Here, the view fetches student records and sends them to a template for) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 607 Td (display.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 592 Td () Tj
/F2 14 Tf 54 577 Td (7. Template in MVT) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 555 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 540 Td (The **Template** layer controls how information is displayed to the user.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 525 Td (Templates are usually HTML files with Django Template Language syntax for) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 510 Td (variables, loops, conditions, filters, and template inheritance.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 495 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 480 Td (Responsibilities of the Template layer include:) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 465 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 450 Td (? Presenting data in HTML format.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 435 Td (? Displaying variables passed by views.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 420 Td (? Using loops and conditions for dynamic pages.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 405 Td (? Reusing layouts through template inheritance.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 70 390 Td (? Keeping presentation separate from Python logic.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 375 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 360 Td (Example concept:) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 345 Td () Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 330 Td (    <h1>Students</h1>) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 318 Td (    <ul>) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 306 Td (      {% for student in students %}) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 294 Td (        <li>{{ student.name }} - {{ student.email }}</li>) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 282 Td (      {% endfor %}) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 270 Td (    </ul>) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 258 Td () Tj
/F2 14 Tf 54 243 Td (8. URL Dispatcher) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 221 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 206 Td (Although URL routing is not part of the MVT acronym, it is essential in) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 191 Td (Django. The URL dispatcher maps incoming request paths to the correct view) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 176 Td (function or class-based view.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 161 Td () Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 146 Td (Example concept:) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 131 Td () Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 116 Td (    urlpatterns = [) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 104 Td (        path\("students/", views.student_list, name="student_list"\),) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 62 92 Td (    ]) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 54 80 Td () Tj
/F1 9 Tf 285 30 Td (Page 3) Tj
ET
